      "message": "Please undo the changes to this file. I believe the libvpx encoder doesn\u0027t support a flipped input image, so we should not waste time fixing bugs related to a flipped image.\n\nJames, Marco: If you agree, I suggest we add a WARNING or DEPRECATED comment to the `vpx_img_flip()` function.",
